---
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
import { ARTICLE_LABEL, LIBRARY_LABELS } from '../../lib/site-config';
---
<section class="ol-hero ol-grid-bg ol-grid-bg--home">
  <div class="ol-container">
    <span class="ol-section-label">BIWOOM · 열린 불교 콘텐츠</span>
    <h1 class="ol-kr">
      <em>열린 불교 콘텐츠 </em><br>
    </h1>
    <p class="ol-lead ol-kr">
      비움에서는 불교경론의 번역과 연구, 불전문학의 전기와 설화, {ARTICLE_LABEL}와 포스트를 함께 읽을 수 있습니다.
    </p>
    <div class="ol-hero-actions">
      <a href={url('/articles')} class="ol-btn ol-btn-accent">이야기카드 보기
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M7 17 17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href={url('/text')} class="ol-btn ol-btn-outline">
        {LIBRARY_LABELS.text} 보기
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M7 17 17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href={url('/story')} class="ol-btn ol-btn-outline">{LIBRARY_LABELS.story} 보기
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M7 17 17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
